      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\nGlobal visual direction:\nCreative intent: Deliver an intimate, heart-warming moment featuring a gentle feminine character directly communicating warmth and affection.; Look: Cinematic soft-focus portrait visual, realistic skin textures and delicate lighting.; Lighting: Warm golden hour natural daylight streaming through soft curtains.; Palette: Warm beige, soft cream, pastel peach, and glowing amber tones.; Texture: Tactile wool knit texture, soft skin glow, light airy fabric.; Composition: Centered portrait framing with smooth depth of field blurring the background.; Visual motif: Golden sunbeams and gentle direct eye contact.; Continuity: Keep wardrobe, hairstyle, and soft warm lighting tone consistent between shots.\nCamera and performance grammar:\nCamera grammar: Slow, subtle forward push transitions into an intimate close-up framing.; Performance rule: Emphasize realistic micro-expressions, delicate lip movements, and authentic sweet smiles.; Editing rhythm: Calm, continuous flow giving sufficient pacing for clean dialogue delivery.\nTimeline:\n[Shot 1, 0.0-4.5s]; The young woman sits in a sunlit cozy room near a window. She turns her head gently towards the camera, her posture relaxed and welcoming, bringing a soft smile to her face as she leans slightly forward.; Performance: Warm, gentle eye contact with eyes sparkling subtly; a tender, affectionate smile forms naturally on her lips.; Environment: Warm golden afternoon sunlight streams through translucent window curtains, highlighting delicate dust motes softly floating in the air.; Visual: Soft rim lighting catching the strands of her hair; creamy background bokeh.; Medium eye-level shot, slowly pushing forward towards the subject.; Transitions from a gentle lingering gaze into an intimate close-up posture.; Beat: Shot pushes closer as her smile widens warm and inviting.; Transition: Smooth spatial cut matching her subtle tilt of head closer to the camera.; Sound: Soft cozy ambient acoustic guitar melody fades in quietly.\n[Shot 2, 4.5-10.0s]; She tilts her head slightly, rests a hand lightly near her cheek with a sweet expression, and speaks clearly with graceful lip movements.; Performance: Her expression is charming, tender, and deeply affectionate, smiling sweetly while effortlessly speaking the line.; Environment: Golden sunbeams cast a warm glow across her cheek and knit sweater.; Visual: Detailed realistic facial micro-expressions, clear lip movement, warm eye catchlights.; Intimate close-up shot, stable with slight organic hand-held warmth.; Completes speaking the phrase and holds a sweet, lingering smile.; Beat: Dialogue delivery occurs smoothly across the middle of the shot.; Transition: Gently lingers on her adorable smile until a slow dissolve fade out.; Sound: Soft, sweet feminine voice speaking clearly in Chinese: '想我嗎我在等你'.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet, cozy sunlit room ambience with gentle indoor acoustics.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nSubtle, romantic acoustic piano and guitar notes playing softly in the background.",
